{
    "title": "Speed Test - Wifi Speed Test",
    "description": "<b>Internet Speed Test & WiFi Tester</b>\r\n\r\nDo you want to know about your Internet Speed? Analyze your Internet speed with our Wifi Speedtest Master. Wifi Speed Test - Internet Speed Check, get detailed insights into your internet speed providing you a complete info about your external & internal IP Address. \r\n\r\nWhile using WiFi Analyzer - Speed Tester app, measuring your internet speed is more easy & simple. Speedtest Master app provides you a detailed info about your ping, uploading speed, downloading speed & many more. WiFi Speed Test is specially designed to test the internet speed, strength & quality of your wireless network. Get a detailed graph of your network speed in Mbps with Speed test Master.\r\n\r\n\u2b50 Key Feature of Speed Test - Internet Speed Test \u2b50\r\n\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Measure your upload, download speed & ping latency\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Get detailed info on your network performance and stability\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Test your WiFi speed accurately with Speed Test Master\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Get information about your surrounding networks with Internet Speed Test\r\n\u2714\ufe0f This app gives you detailed speed test information with real-time grapgh\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Measure your Wi-Fi speed in Kbs, Mbs & Mbps\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Save past test results for comparison and performance tracking over time\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Track your mobile data usage with Data Usage Alert\r\n\r\n<b> WiFi SpeedTest & Speed Test Master</b>\r\nWith WiFi Speed meter, you can check your internet speed, it provides real-time data on download speed, upload speed, and ping. Analyze signal strength, find weak spots, and optimize your connection with Internet Speed Test.\r\n\r\n<b>Speed Test - Internet Speed Test</b>\r\nTest your internet speed to check the overall performance of your network connection. Speed Test - WiFi Tester is connected to different servers to give you an accurate report on your internet connection. This test measures detailed internet speed including download & upload speed and ping test. Our app achieves the best internet performance test by providing insights into any speed issue.\r\n\r\n<b>WiFi Speed Check - Wi-Fi Speed Test</b>\r\nWiFi Speedtest Master gives you complete info about the speed test with real-time graph. You can measure your internet speed in Mbs, Kbs, & Mbps. WiFi Analyzer helps in analyzing the problems, it collects data & evaluates the network performance. Get information about wireless signals around you with Speed Test Analyzer.\r\n\r\n<b>WiFi Ping Test - Network Test</b>\r\nInternet test and Wifi speed meter, test your Wifi ping to check for latency issues. Get detailed information on your WiFi speed and understand how different factors affect your connection. Our Internet Speed Meter is user-friendly and provides details on your internet performance, including historical data and trends.\r\n\r\nIf you're facing network & internet speed problems, download our WiFi Speed Test - Internet Test app to free get free & accurate results in 30 seconds. Speed Test Master is an Internet Speed Meter that helps you in testing speeds of 4G, 5G, DSL & ADSL. With Speed Test WiFi Analyzer has a history feature that helps you in comparing the internet speed in different tests.\r\n\r\nBroadband/Bandwidth doesn't meet the promise the network provider gives to you?\r\nDownload the WiFi SpeedTest Master to test connection with one touch and manage your network easily.\r\n\r\nNote: Turn off all your downloading files while doing Internet Speed Test, this helps to get more accurate results.",
